# Dwarven Castle Guard: "When this creature dies, create a 1/1 colorless Hero creature token." Bot2's Lightning Bolt kills the first Guard
# (2/1) on turn 2, and Bot1 gets a colorless 1/1 Hero (CR 700.4). The second Guard, exiled by Swords to Plowshares on turn 4, does not die,
# so it makes no token: Bot1 has the one Hero and the exiled Guard is gone.

